# Testing

## Mandatory

- `packages/lib/**` — 100% line coverage. CI fails on regression.
- New Postgres RPC or RLS policy — at least one pgTAP test (positive + negative).
- New Edge Function — Deno test covering happy path + auth failure + idempotency.
- New hook in `apps/mobile/src/features/**` — RNTL `renderHook` test.

## Naming

- `*.test.ts` for unit tests, `*.spec.ts` for integration/Playwright.
- One `describe` per public function / hook / component.

## Style

- Arrange / Act / Assert blocks separated by a blank line.
- One assertion-per-behavior — no kitchen-sink tests.
- Fixtures live next to the test in `__fixtures__/`. No shared global mocks.

## Forbidden

- `it.skip` / `xit` without a linked issue.
- Snapshot tests for business logic — only for stable presentational components.
- Network calls in unit tests. Use `msw` or DB transaction rollback.

## Running

- `pnpm test` — Jest + RNTL across all packages.
- `pnpm test:db` — `supabase test db` (pgTAP).
- `pnpm test:fn` — `supabase functions test` (Deno).
- `pnpm gate` — typecheck + lint + all of the above.
